Package: shadercandy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libgl1-mesa-glx | libgl1, libx11-6, libxss1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1
Description: Cross-platform GPU-accelerated screensaver
 ShaderCandy is a high-performance screensaver engine delivering 
 real-time procedural graphics through native GPU APIs.
 .
 Features include:
  - 20+ visual effects (fractals, particles, raymarching)
  - Interactive mouse physics
  - Shader hot-reloading
  - Cross-fade transitions
  - SIMD optimizations (AVX2/NEON)
  - X11 and Wayland support
 .
 This package provides the Linux X11/OpenGL/Wayland screensaver.
